flowchart TD
  subgraph branch.yml: push to a feature branch
    P[Push] --> CI[Lint, tests, dbt build on DuckDB, Terraform validate, Docker build]
    CI --> Q{Source hash already QA-passed?}
    Q -- yes --> SKIP[Nothing to deploy]
    Q -- no --> E{Image for this source hash exists?}
    E -- no --> B[Build image; tag = source hash; label = commit SHA]
    E -- yes --> D1
    B --> D1[Deploy DEV; run pipeline on 5% sample]
    D1 --> D2[Copy digest to QA; deploy QA; run pipeline on full data]
    D2 --> T[Add tag qa-passed-SOURCEHASH to that digest]
  end
  subgraph main.yml: merge to main
    M[Merge] --> V{Tag qa-passed-SOURCEHASH exists?}
    V -- no --> X[Fail: re-run the branch]
    V -- yes --> D3[Copy that digest to PROD registry; deploy PROD by digest]
    D3 --> DOC[Publish dbt docs]
  end
  T -.-> M
